! Bhairavi.scl
!
Bhairavi in E - Nadi (just intonation). Devotional and contemplative; all komal except Ma and Pa. Phrygian in feel.
!
 7
!
 16/15
 6/5
 4/3
 3/2
 8/5
 9/5
 2/1
!
! Scale degrees (the annotations that used to sit on the pitch lines):
!   re    111.73 cents
!   ga    315.64 cents
!   Ma    498.04 cents
!   Pa    701.96 cents
!   dha   813.69 cents
!   ni   1017.60 cents
!   Sa'  1200.00 cents
!
! Matches Nadi's internal tuning exactly, so instruments in this tuning
! and Nadi's resonators lock together instead of beating.
! Sattvagenic - sattvagenic.com/nadi
! Intended root: E3 = 329.6276 Hz — set your synth's base/root note to E.
